### Crear un gasto valido (guarda un gasto de prueba en la base)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compra de alimentos",
  "amount": 2500,
  "category": "Alimentos"
}

### Consultar los gastos
GET http://localhost:4000/api/expenses

### Probar un monto invalido (no debe guardar el gasto)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Gasto invalido",
  "amount": -100,
  "category": "Otros"
}
